# shadcn-svelte primitives

Generated pages import shadcn primitives from
`#lib/components/ui/<name>/index.js`. The generator does not vendor these
components — obtain them with the shadcn-svelte CLI against the
`components.json` in this directory:

```sh
npx shadcn-svelte@next add {% for p in shadcn_primitives %}{{ p }}{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}{% endfor %}
```

Run the command from this directory (`ui/`). The set covers every
primitive the generated entity pages use, including the ux-rules surface
(`dropdown-menu` for the row/child-item action menus, `tooltip` for
truncated cells).
